<span id="S6.T2.2.1.1.6.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S6.T2.2.1.1.6.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Total
<br class="ltx_break">Time (s)</span></span>
</span></th></tr>
