<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 10. </span>Accuracy and head-to-head win rate against the SFT baseline for different preference-optimisation (PO) objectives. “Uniform” uses random sampling; “w/o CRej” applies hard-example mining; “Ours” adds counterfactual rationales.</figcaption>
</figure>
